		<p>Push the temperature control lever up or down to the desired temperature.</p>
		<p>When pushing the lever, the temperature will increase or decrease by 0.5 °C (1 °F in Fahrenheit). When set to the lowest temperature setting, the air conditioning will operate continuously.</p>
